{"ID":"20240506102409-ei3cttw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240506102409-ei3cttw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102409-ei3cttw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702084641-uyz3tfp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613113436-ayoiowf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702084641-uyz3tfp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"307石长生","updated":"20240702090312"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240702084641-uyz3tfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702084641-uyz3tfp","updated":"20240702090312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240613113432-3b8im5x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113432-3b8im5x"}},{"ID":"20240613113441-4b0fpb0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113441-4b0fpb0","updated":"20240613113454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113441-t8p97iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113441-t8p97iq","updated":"20240613113441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113441-tqgbbwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113441-tqgbbwb","updated":"20240613113441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主寒热，恶创，火热，辟鬼气不祥（《御览》作辟恶气，不祥，鬼毒）。一名丹草（《御览》引云：丹沙草）。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113441-8al8i4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113441-8al8i4h","updated":"20240613113441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：石长生，神农苦，雷公辛，一经甘，生咸阳（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113441-zd1qybv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113441-zd1qybv","updated":"20240613113441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生咸阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113509-d6kc119","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113509-d6kc119"}},{"ID":"20240613113510-07y871f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113510-07y871f","updated":"20240613113515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113510-at83wl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113510-at83wl4","updated":"20240613113635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸苦，微寒，有毒。主寒热恶疮大热，辟鬼气不祥，下三虫。一名丹草。生咸阳山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113656-c4wnkag","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113656-c4wnkag"}},{"ID":"20240613113658-iizd2t5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113658-iizd2t5","updated":"20240613113658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113658-95ll5xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113658-95ll5xy","updated":"20240613113658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸苦，微寒。有毒。生石岩下，叶似蕨黑光如漆，花紫。用茎叶治诸风疥癣寒热，辟邪杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113721-4sanh0a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113721-4sanh0a"}},{"ID":"20240613113722-njvefhb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113722-njvefhb","updated":"20240613113726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113722-8rqkerg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113722-8rqkerg","updated":"20240613113722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，有毒．下三虫．生咸阳．"}]},{"ID":"20240613113722-a9n5r23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113722-a9n5r23","updated":"20240613113722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶石长生，味咸，微寒．主寒热恶疮大热，辟鬼气不祥．一名丹草．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240613113710-j42176f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113710-j42176f"}},{"ID":"20240613113711-5opfevn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113711-5opfevn","updated":"20240613113716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113711-w07pb7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113711-w07pb7k","updated":"20240613113711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，微寒，有毒。主寒热恶疮大热，辟鬼气不祥。下三虫。一名丹草。生咸阳山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113711-1gs1huf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113711-1gs1huf","updated":"20240613113711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗中虽时有采者，方药亦不复用。近道亦有，是细细草叶，花紫色尔。南中多生石岩下，叶如光漆，高尺余，不与余草杂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113711-gpncc9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113711-gpncc9h","updated":"20240613113711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕今市人用KT 筋草为之，叶似青葙，茎细劲紫色，今太常用者是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113648-gql3i6p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113648-gql3i6p"}},{"ID":"20240613113649-sbq4a2o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113649-sbq4a2o","updated":"20240613113653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113649-t1dfhko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113649-t1dfhko","updated":"20240613113649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，微寒，有毒。主寒热，恶疮，大热，辟鬼气不祥，下三虫。一名丹草。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113649-e9t7z7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113649-e9t7z7w","updated":"20240613113649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生咸阳山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113649-stzbvg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113649-stzbvg2","updated":"20240613113649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶俗中虽时有采者，方药亦不复用。近道亦有，是细细草叶，花紫色尔。南中多生石岩下，叶似蕨，而细如龙须草大，黑如光漆，高尺余，不与余草杂也。唐本注云∶今市人用KT （音零）筋草为之，叶似青葙，茎细劲紫色，今太常用者是也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶石长生皮，臣。亦云石长生也。味酸，有小毒。治疥癣，逐诸风，治百邪鬼魅。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113649-eq99mmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113649-eq99mmg","updated":"20240613113649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本余下三虫，谓长虫、赤虫、蛲虫也。苗高尺许，用茎、叶，五月、六月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113746-8x4mhse","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113746-8x4mhse"}},{"ID":"20240613113747-v6d09bf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113747-v6d09bf","updated":"20240613113757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113747-4l7ttm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113747-4l7ttm6","updated":"20240613113747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、苦，微寒，有毒。主治寒热恶疮，大热，辟鬼气不祥。下三虫。一名丹草。生咸阳山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113747-omq2k9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113747-omq2k9y","updated":"20240613113747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"世中虽时有采者，方药亦不复用。近道亦有，是细细草叶，花紫色尔。南中多生石岩下，叶似蕨，而细如龙须草大，黑如光漆，高尺余，不与余草杂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113432-fr67xg8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113432-fr67xg8"}},{"ID":"20240613113433-yyl2oxg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-yyl2oxg","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石长生"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-a8w9b6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-a8w9b6s","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-93gl7c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-93gl7c7","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Chánɡ Shēnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-f1qnsph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-f1qnsph","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-jzts955","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-jzts955","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 丹草、长生草、丹沙草、生肌草、石中珠、岩浮萍、猪毛七、水猪毛七、猪鬃草、猪毛脚筋草"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-gfbw4g5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-gfbw4g5","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-4scnyyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-4scnyyh","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石长生，始载于《本经》，一名丹草，列入下品。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-gid0esg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-gid0esg","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．《别录》云：“石长生，生咸阳山谷。”2．《本草经集注》云：“近道亦有，是细细草叶，花紫色尔。南中多生石岩下，叶似藏而细，如龙须草大，黑如光漆，高尺余，不与余草杂也。”3．《纲目》引宋祁《益部方物记》云：“长生草，生山阴蕨地，修茎茸叶，色似桧而泽，经冬不凋。‘所述特征与本种相似，但所绘之图似为凤尾蕨。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-w0fgtss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-w0fgtss","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-fxfwjpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-fxfwjpl","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为铁线蕨科植物单盖铁线蕨的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-scewgd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-scewgd9","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Adiantum monochlamys Eaton［A.venustum Don var.monochlamys Keys］"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-c8gtgcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-c8gtgcf","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采收，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-muqr62x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-muqr62x","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-qt7g4fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-qt7g4fl","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔800m左右的林下溪沟边。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-88lxecy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-88lxecy","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于浙江、江西、台湾、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-za8nxfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-za8nxfr","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-mq037au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-mq037au","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 植株高16-30cm。根茎横生，连同叶柄基部被紫棕色、线状披针形鳞片。叶近生，或散生；叶柄长8-12cm，腹面略扁平，深棕色至紫棕色，有光泽；叶片薄革质，无毛，狭卵形，长14-20cm，宽6-8cm，先端渐尖。基部圆楔形，三回羽状；羽片8-12对，互生，斜展，有柄，卵形，下部的长4-5.5cm，宽2-2.5cm，二回羽状；羽片1-4对，柄纤细，三角状卵形，下部的长1.5-2cm，宽1-1.5cm，一回羽状；末回羽片1对，互生，平展，有短柄，倒三角状卵形或扇形，长5-8mm，宽4-8mm，先端圆形有钝齿，基部楔形至圆楔形，顶生羽片倒卵形略大；叶脉为多回二叉分枝，直达小羽片的锯齿尖端，两面均明显。孢子囊群近圆形，背生于羽片先端凹缺内，每羽片1个；囊群盖近圆形或长圆形，红褐色，全缘或呈波状，宿存。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-p41vox9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-p41vox9","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-xinrdzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-xinrdzq","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含铁线蕨烯(adianene)，5-铁线蕨烯臭氧化物(adian-5-ene-ozonide)，7-羊齿烯(7-ferene)，雁齿烯(filicene)，羟基铁线蕨酮(hydroxyadiantone)，铁线蕨酮(adiantone)，金丝桃甙(hyperin)，紫云英甙(astragalin)，洋李甙(prunin)。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-jed3969","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-jed3969","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-zfh758r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-zfh758r","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸；微寒；有小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-e0rdzqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-e0rdzqd","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-6fgthgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-6fgthgh","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热化痰；解毒。主肺热咳嗽；感冒发热；痈肿疔毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-nyvavcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-nyvavcr","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-h217pd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-h217pd6","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g。外用：适量，捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-fj238td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-fj238td","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-rykhxy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-rykhxy8","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》:“四时不雕(凋)，故曰长生。”又多生石岩上，而名石长生。丹草、丹沙草，皆因叶背生有红褐色孢子囊。以“猪毛”、“猪鬃”称之者，皆因其叶柄细长深棕色，其基部及根茎被有紫棕色、似毛状鳞片而得名。"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-4cd8tdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-4cd8tdv","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-5tuspb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-5tuspb6","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《新修本草》：“今市人用(鼠令)筋草为之，叶似青葙，茎细劲紫色，今太常用者是也。”"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-b0tgegw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-b0tgegw","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613113433-38jtxh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113433-38jtxh1","updated":"20240613113433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613113434-j03niyb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613113434-j03niyb"}},{"ID":"20240613113436-ayoiowf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613113436-ayoiowf"}}]}